  "description": "EasyRabbitFlow: high-performance RabbitMQ client for .NET. Fluent configuration, optional topology (queue/exchange/dead-letter) generation, application-owned exchange declaration, reflection-free consumers, transient-failure retry with dead-letter reprocessing, temporary batch processing, queue state helpers, OpenTelemetry-ready tracing/metrics and a native health check. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 and .NET 8.",
